WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.700
[Instrumental music]
Your SaaS. Ready to make yours.
A coherent foundation for your next product.

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:13.400
A considered experience, from the very first sign-in.
Email sign-in, with Google and GitHub integration points.

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:21.100
Give new users a clear path into your product.
Registration that feels like part of the same interface.

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:26.800
Keep password recovery part of the same coherent experience.
Recovery emails use your configured email provider.

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:38.500
Sign in with an example account and open the application.
Real session. Isolated example workspace.

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:46.200
Open the right workspace, with its projects, people and activity.
Workspace-scoped data and role-aware actions.

00:00:46.200 --> 00:01:01.900
Understand project activity and your team at a glance.
Metrics and chart data come from the selected workspace.

00:01:01.900 --> 00:01:21.600
Set the palette, typography, theme and sidebar to suit your product.
Immediate visual changes. Consistent components.

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:31.300
Switch between list and grid while keeping the same workflow.
Descriptions, status, assignees and archiving included.

00:01:31.300 --> 00:01:47.000
Create a project, describe the goal and assign a responsible teammate.
Saved to your workspace through the real application.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:02:06.700
Add a task, set a due date and keep the conversation beside the work.
Tasks, assignees and comments are persisted in PostgreSQL.

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:16.400
Review members, roles and pending invitations in one place.
Extend the same workspace rules as your product grows.

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:24.100
An editable profile and a coherent set of account pages.
Profile, account, appearance and billing share the same navigation.

00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:33.800
Docker, PostgreSQL and documented setup commands.
Use your own credentials and the included local example data.

00:02:33.800 --> 00:02:41.500
Configuration, diagnostics and guides give your team a clear starting point.
Extend your product on a foundation you can understand.

00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:51.500
Explore PyColors Starter Pro.
